<title>BELGIUM: Trade in Ackermans suspended - bourse.</title>
<headline>Trade in Ackermans suspended - bourse.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade in shares in Belgian holding company Ackermans &amp; Van Haaren NV (AVH) has been suspended pending a company statement, the Brussels bourse said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>Trade will resume on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The share closed at 4,840 Belgian francs on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
